    "name": "Mycelium: The Silent Contract",
    "steam_appid": 3583970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYCELIUM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no life after death but there's always more work to do. Having signed a contract in exchange for a successful life, now that it has ended, you are obliged to perform tasks for a company called Mycelium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/d43cf6333837707f7f7754108700ef84.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission you arrive at a dark and motionless forest where silence is your best friend. The forest is never the same, so you'll have to find your bearings over and over again. Don't get lost - or you might never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/11e87cb286bd25fa09f8c1d868da94cd.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU GATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for mycelium as that's what you need to complete the contract and free your soul. Buy equipment the company provides and find valuables to get more time in the future missions. The more time you get, the more mysteries you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/dd7ef966da3be56ad97c00a190199e92.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mycelium you've got to extract from the mission. But hurry up - you can't stay in the forest forever. The longer you stay, the more dangerous it becomes, as there is always someone or something that wants your mycelium more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/6adc1dcb071e21376805a1987a77b8a8.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not your friends, but other contractors may help you to speed things up. Take care of each other but always remember to take care of yourself first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/220f8e8bc8030dc5482d85667cfe2105.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYCELIUM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no life after death but there's always more work to do. Having signed a contract in exchange for a successful life, now that it has ended, you are obliged to perform tasks for a company called Mycelium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/d43cf6333837707f7f7754108700ef84.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission you arrive at a dark and motionless forest where silence is your best friend. The forest is never the same, so you'll have to find your bearings over and over again. Don't get lost - or you might never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/11e87cb286bd25fa09f8c1d868da94cd.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU GATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for mycelium as that's what you need to complete the contract and free your soul. Buy equipment the company provides and find valuables to get more time in the future missions. The more time you get, the more mysteries you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/dd7ef966da3be56ad97c00a190199e92.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mycelium you've got to extract from the mission. But hurry up - you can't stay in the forest forever. The longer you stay, the more dangerous it becomes, as there is always someone or something that wants your mycelium more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/6adc1dcb071e21376805a1987a77b8a8.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not your friends, but other contractors may help you to speed things up. Take care of each other but always remember to take care of yourself first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583970/extras/220f8e8bc8030dc5482d85667cfe2105.avif?t=1755344256\" data-has-big width=800 height=472 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You arrive. You gather. You extract. Join an endless cycle of hunting for Mycelium in a forest that is never the same. Work alone or with other contractors, solve the mysteries and avoid dangers. But don't worry - you can't die twice. There are things worse than that.",
